  "description": "Game notifications? Quests, and a magical item shop... inside a convenience store? After getting married, Bipa's life turns into a video game! Things were going great with her hot and attentive husband—until he has to head off to the frontlines of a war zone, leaving her alone to deal with her insufferable in-laws and terrified for her his safety. One day, she discovers a powerful but expensive item in the magic shop. Can she earn enough points to save her husband’s life? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
